Roda uma Dinamica Molecular QM/MM exploratório para refinamento posterior 
--------------------------------
#INPUT_TYPE pkl rta_qmmm_opt_am1.pkl
#RUN_SIMULATION  Molecular_Dynamics
#MD_METHOD LeapFrog
#PRESSURE 1.0
#PRESSURE_COUPLING 2000
#PRESSURE_CONTROL yes
#TEMPERATURE_SCALE_OPTION constant
#TEMPERATURE_SCALE 10.0
#TIME_STEP 0.001
#COLLISION_FREQ 25.0
#INITIAL_TEMPERATURE 20.0
#EQUILIBRATION_STEPS 20000
#HEATING_STEPS 10000
#PRODUCTION_STEPS 50000
#SAMPLING_HEATING 200
#SAMPLING_EQUILIBRATION 200
#SAMPLING_PRODUCTION 1000
#TEMPERATURE 315.15
#LOG_FREQUENCY 10
#SAVE_NAME rta_qmmm_md_am1
